in{aligned}12 & =2pt \\\\ 6 & =pt \\\\ t & =\\frac{6}{p}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the first equation and solving for $p,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12 & =p{(\\frac{6}{p})}^{2} \\\\ 12 & =p\\cdot \\frac{36}{{p}^{2}} \\\\ 12 & =\\frac{36}{p} \\\\ p & =\\frac{36}{12} \\\\ p & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the parametric equations of the parabola are\n\n$$\nx+5=(3){t}^{2},\\,y+3=2(3)t,\n$$\n\nwhich simplify to\n\n$$\nx+5=3{t}^{2},\\,y+3=6t.\n$$" 13194139534441 true] [17592186288382 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288383 13194139534441 true] [17592186288382 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288384 13194139534441 true] [17592186288382 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288385 13194139534441 true] [17592186288382 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288386 13194139534441 true] [17592186288382 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288387 13194139534441 true] [17592186288382 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534441 true] [17592186288382 1041 "selection" 13194139534441 true] [17592186288382 1104 #edb/ref 17592186288385 13194139534441 true] [17592186288382 1110 #uuid "77e16c48-9b1a-5f6d-9db8-0fd49008fb93" 13194139534441 true] [17592186288383 1034 "x+5=-3{t}^{2},\\,\\,y+3=-6t" 13194139534441 true] [17592186288383 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534441 true] [17592186288383 1111 #uuid "2db5ca93-30e8-5da6-990b-d8942febd9ed" 13194139534441 true] [17592186288384 1034 "x+3=6t,\\,\\,y+5=3{t}^{2}" 13194139534441 true] [17592186288384 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534441 true] [17592186288384 1111 #uuid "ac2dd016-0425-5d40-ad73-06dd0e16f843" 13194139534441 true] [17592186288385 1034 "x+5=3{t}^{2},\\,\\,y+3=6t" 13194139534441 true] [17592186288385 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534441 true] [17592186288385 1111 #uuid "cdb78dab-6fb8-5638-8472-2e7c7e5f3c4b" 13194139534441 true] [17592186288386 1034 "x+3=3{t}^{2},\\,\\,y+5=6t" 13194139534441 true] [17592186288386 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534441 true] [17592186288386 1111 #uuid "e6d413c9-bc84-50ff-ba3f-ca7e5422b364" 13194139534441 true] [17592